  "description": "◇ ‘What is “Muv-Luv Unlimited: The Day After”?’\nA spin-off title of the Muv-Luv series, following on from ‘Muv-Luv’ and ‘Muv-Luv Alternative’.\nThe second title in a spin-off series originating from “Muv-Luv Unlimited”, which diverges into a different future from the anime-adapted “Muv-Luv Alternative.”\nAfter protagonist Shirogane Takeru sees the heroine’s escape from Earth in “Muv-Luv Unlimited”, the story depicts those left behind on Earth who nonetheless continue to fight against their doom.\n\n◇ Story\nThe massive gravitational distortion brought about by Operation Babylon turned Earth into a world of death.\nIn Tacoma, part of the U.S.-controlled Seattle Imperial Lease Territory and one of humanity’s few remaining habitable zones, was Imperial Japanese Army Lieutenant Tatsunami Hibiki.\nHe continued to fight day after day to defend Seattle from relentless BETA attacks.\nWith food scarce and ammunition supplies running low, Hibiki fought on in a desperate struggle to survive.",
